sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend
    participant Ingestion
    participant Supabase
    participant Preprocessing
    participant Embedding
    participant Weaviate

    Admin->>Frontend: Upload document PDF
    Frontend->>Ingestion: Envoyer fichier
    Ingestion->>Supabase: Stocker fichier + metadonnees
    Ingestion->>Preprocessing: Extraire et segmenter
    Preprocessing-->>Ingestion: Chunks normalises
    Ingestion->>Embedding: Demander embeddings
    Embedding->>Weaviate: Indexer vecteurs
    Weaviate-->>Embedding: Confirmation
    Embedding-->>Ingestion: Indexation terminee
    Ingestion-->>Frontend: Document pret
